<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπορ-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>travel</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς πείρατα
				οὐκ ἂν ἐξεύροιο πᾶσαν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενος ὁδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					45
				</span></i>
			; <i>march</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.12.4
			</span></i>, al.: c.acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χώραν</span>
			<i>traverse</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				30.14
			</span></i>: c.dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀγροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοὺς τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLille</u>
					3.78
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπάρειμι</span>
			 (B) <i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, of a general, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενος</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ συστήματα παρεκάλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.12.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ πλῆθος</span>
			<i>come before</i> the assembly, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.9.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					8.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>go</i> or <i>run through</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ διανοίᾳ, τῇ ὄψει</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.470a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. Astron.,
				<i>reach</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τῶν κέντρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					99
				</span></i>
			: c.acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίου τὸν Κριὸν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i>begins to traverse</i> the
			Ram, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.172c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν ἱστόν</span>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐποίχομαι</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Ephor.
				5J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>. <i>take legal
				proceedings against</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.96.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
